{"id": "x009-001", "text": "Long catch up with Nina. She's finally moving to Leeds, sometime in early March 2027, once the sale goes through. Wei is staying in London for now and is not thrilled about it. Remind me to ask Nina for the new address before she goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the sale goes through", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in London", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Nina for the new address", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x009-002", "text": "Julien's housewarming is Saturday 14 November 2026. He and Georgia got the flat in Bristol in the end, top floor, no lift. Said bring nothing but I'll take wine anyway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 14 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "top floor, no lift", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "x009-009", "text": "Ran into Astrid at the station. She's left Novak & Partners and starts somewhere new in January 2027. Her partner Giulia is expecting, due early May. They're looking for somewhere bigger before the baby comes, maybe out towards Surrey. Astrid's mum is moving in with them for a few months after the birth, which Astrid is very relaxed about and Giulia less so. Must send Giulia something small.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left Novak & Partners", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "somewhere new", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early May", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for somewhere bigger", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the baby comes", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the birth", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "less so", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Giulia something small", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "x009-013", "text": "Sinead got the flat! The one on Elm Road. Moving in 1 December 2026, keys the day before. Her cat Biscuit is going to be furious about the stairs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Elm Road", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Moving in", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 December 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "keys", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x009-016", "text": "Chloe and Ioana had people round on Friday. Lovely evening. Ioana is doing a pottery course now, Tuesdays, and is obsessed. Chloe's still at the council, still hates it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had people round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "obsessed", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "x009-021", "text": "Wei Nakamura from Nina's work invited me to his birthday drinks, end of next week. Nice of him, barely know him. Probably go for one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei Nakamura", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely know him", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x009-022", "text": "Aditi and Sean are definitely moving to Edinburgh, sometime in the summer of 2027. Sean has a transfer lined up and Aditi will work remotely. They've got two kids so it's schools first, then a house. Their eldest, Rohan, is not happy about leaving his friends. I should ask Aditi how the school visits go next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Edinburgh", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the summer of 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "work remotely", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "two kids", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not happy about leaving his friends", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Aditi how the school visits go", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school visits", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "x009-025", "text": "Florin's band is playing at the Lexington on 7 November 2026. He was very nervous about it, first gig with the new drummer. Andre and I are going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing at the Lexington", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "x009-026", "text": "Note to self: Giulia's surname is Dubois, not Dupont. Embarrassing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "surname is Dubois", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "x009-027", "text": "Luca and his wife Mei are expecting twins, sometime in the spring. Found out after the 12 week scan last week. He's beaming, she's mostly sick all the time. Need to get them a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "12 week scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beaming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly sick all the time", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "x009-028", "text": "Talked to Andre after five a side. His flat viewing in Hackney on Wednesday went well, he's put in an offer. Fingers crossed. He's also getting a dog once he's settled, a rescue greyhound apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after five a side"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat viewing in Hackney", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a dog", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once he's settled", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "x009-033", "text": "Mehmet's mum is turning 70 in the new year, January or February. Big family party in Izmir. He's going out for two weeks. He said the cousins are all coming from Germany.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning 70", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January or February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family party in Izmir", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x009-036", "text": "Catch up with Sinead and Khadija at the pub. Sinead's settling in at the new flat, though Biscuit has already broken a lamp. Khadija's mum has her results back and it's nothing serious, huge relief. Khadija is still moving in January but less of a rush now. We're doing a goodbye dinner for her sometime mid December, I'm meant to book somewhere. Don't forget to book the Thai place for 8.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "huge relief", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "goodbye dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime mid December", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the Thai place", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e3", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "x009-043", "text": "Georgia's back from Swansea. Doing a bit better, she said. Her mum is selling the family house in the spring and Georgia is helping clear it out. Probably a hard few months. I should take her for a drink next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit better", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the family house", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for a drink", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x009-044", "text": "Rafael Adeyemi from the climbing group invited everyone to his 30th on Saturday 5 December 2026. Fancy dress, theme is nineties. Dr Banerjee is apparently coming as a Spice Girl.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael Adeyemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "climbing group", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 5 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Banerjee", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "x009-045", "text": "Wei said the office move to Canary Wharf got pushed back to March 2027. He'll have an awful commute from Walthamstow. Doesn't drink coffee, only green tea, remember for when he comes over.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "office move to Canary Wharf", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't drink coffee, only green tea", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he comes over"}]}
{"id": "x009-046", "text": "Uncle Dimitri is coming over from Thessaloniki sometime after Christmas, staying with Mum for a fortnight. Need to sort the spare room before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Dimitri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Thessaloniki", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the spare room", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x009-048", "text": "Imogen is doing okay, she says. Throwing herself into work and marathon training, London in April 2027. Aoife thinks she's overdoing it. She's coming to dinner on the 4th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "marathon training", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "London", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "x009-049", "text": "Julien and Georgia's dinner party was so much fun. Julien made his famous tagine. Georgia's started at the architecture firm and loves it. Text Julien to say thanks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "famous tagine", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the architecture firm", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Julien to say thanks", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}]}
